              "value": "Project: Payment Gateway Integration  Attendees: - Jay - Backend Lead - QA Lead - Client SPOC  Discussion: - Client expects integration completion by next sprint. - Backend team is waiting for vendor API approval. - QA mentioned testing may slip by one week. - There is dependency on external payment provider. - UAT timeline may be impacted.  Actions: - Jay to coordinate with client by Friday. - Backend team to follow up with vendor.  Risks: - Delay in vendor approval may impact UAT.",
